OL,3,GNEWSA'I went from losing my sight to
OL,4,Astyling the stars'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA celebrity hairdresser who now styles
OL,7,Fthe stars says he rebuilt his life
OL,8,Fafter losing his vision ` even though
OL,9,Fthe experience made him hit rock
OL,10,Fbottom.
OL,12,FJJ Savani from Wellingborough,
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire, is grateful to a
OL,14,Fmystery donor who enrolled him at the
OL,15,FLondon School of Barbering as he tried
OL,16,Fto get back on track.
OL,18,F"It was worth going through the
OL,19,Fstruggles and the fight. At the time I
OL,20,Fdidn't think it would happen, but it's
OL,21,Fmade me who I am today," he says.
